  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> moderate Light; <strong>CL</strong> 10th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> none; <strong>Price</strong> 10,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> -</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nAn icon tattoo often takes the form of a holy symbol or religious imagery, with coloration appropriate to the image or deity. This tattoo can be designed to count as a holy symbol and divine focus for characters that require one (such as characters with the Focus Casting drawback). In addition, all allies within the primary radius of your light gain a +1 morale bonus on all saving throws.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nForge Charm, Light sphere (Beacon Of Hope (light)); <strong>Cost</strong> 5,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/charms#toc54\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
